                                Active member of the <strong>Indian Orthodontic Society (IOS)</strong> and verified member of the <a href="https://dentist.ida.org.in/dentist/riddhi-kantilal-patel" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-teal-700 font-bold underline">Indian Dental Association (Check Profile on IDA)</a>, ensuring uncompromising clinical excellence.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-3.5 border border-slate-100 space-y-2 text-xs">
