                        The Infinora Standard
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base">
                        Built on six fundamental pillars of clinical excellence and patient trust.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                    <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-2">
                        <div class="text-2xl font-black text-teal-700">01</div>
                        <h3 class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-base">Specialist-Led Care</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
                            Every case is evaluated and guided directly by qualified MDS specialists rather than generalized practitioners.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-2">
                        <div class="text-2xl font-black text-teal-700">02</div>
                        <h3 class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-base">Thoughtful Diagnosis</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
                            Comprehensive clinical evaluations focusing on root causes, long-term oral health, and functional preservation.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-2">
                        <div class="text-2xl font-black text-teal-700">03</div>
                        <h3 class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-base">Transparent Treatment Planning</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
                            Clear, written explanations of treatment options, phases, and cost structures with zero hidden surprises.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-2">
                        <div class="text-2xl font-black text-teal-700">04</div>
                        <h3 class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-base">Modern Diagnostics</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
                            Deployment of high-definition intraoral cameras, digital radiography, and 3D optical scanning for precision mapping.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-2">
                        <div class="text-2xl font-black text-teal-700">05</div>
                        <h3 class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-base">Sterilization Protocols</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
