                        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
                            As part of our broader clinical philosophy, <strong>"Fixing Smile Design"</strong> represents our nuanced approach to balancing dental alignment with natural facial proportions, lip support, and jawline aesthetics.
